# Day 1 Theory – HTML Structure

What is HTML?
HTML = HyperText Markup Language
It is the skeleton of every website. It only describes structure and content. It does not style or make things interactive.

# Semantic HTML (Most Important Concept Today)
Semantic tags tell the browser and developers what the content actually means.

|Tag |Meaning | Why we use it |
|<header> |Top section of the page | Logo, name, navigation |
|<nav> | Navigation | linksMenu |
